WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.984
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW lets you update a compatible
view definition without first dropping the

00:00:04.997 --> 00:00:10.570
object This is useful when the interface should
remain available under the

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:16.976
same name But compatibility matters Changing

00:00:17.002 --> 00:00:22.291
column names meanings types or grain can still
affect downstream users even if the SQL

00:00:22.318 --> 00:00:23.344
command succeeds
